I ignored all of the strange signals I received that day.
Feeling isolated, I later get a report from HQ about strange transmissions in my area of space. Not having proof of the communications, I have no findings to report to HQ.
Disappointed, they relocate me to routine patrols in a less-important remote sector of space. I never talk to anyone again. And nobody ever comes to check on me.
<b>ENDING 1/5: Forever Alone</b>
<<detour End>>
